{"unit_id":"xiaozhengdeng__dsh_center-column-shift#card-1","repo":"xiaozhengdeng/dsh_center-column-shift","commit":"a922deeb1fe712a5053656d45a482c0c519ad555","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Center Column Shift 是 DeepSeek Harness 的 Web 客户端界面插件，通过向 shell.overlay 注册悬浮拖动把手，平移整个会话列，为右侧插件面板腾出空间。用户可拖动把手调整会话内容与输入框的位置，也可双击或点击复位按钮恢复原位；会话节点重建时插件重新定位滚动区域并恢复当前偏移。适合需要同时查看聊天内容和右侧插件面板的用户。无需额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:252-265","src/client/index.ts:203-248"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaozhengdeng__dsh_center-column-shift#card-2","repo":"xiaozhengdeng/dsh_center-column-shift","commit":"a922deeb1fe712a5053656d45a482c0c519ad555","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Center Column Shift is a DeepSeek Harness web UI plugin with a draggable handle in shell.overlay. Drag it to move the conversation and composer left for side panels; double-click or press reset to restore them. The offset is reapplied after session nodes rebuild.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:252-265","src/client/index.ts:203-248"]}
